                <h3 class="project-title">Panatiko</h3>
                <p class="project-desc">
                    A gritty, Filipino-inspired 2D survival horror game exploring fanaticism and exploitation. You play as Alex, a young woman whose mother has fallen victim to a mysterious and powerful cult operating out of an abandoned mall. Led by Arthur Valdez, the cult lures vulnerable townsfolk with false promises of ayuda (relief goods) while slowly stripping away their freedom and sanity. GOAL: Infiltrate a cult operating in an abandoned mall using stealth, hacking, and radio guidance to save your family.
                </p>
                <ul class="subtext-bullets">
                    <li><strong>Game Jam Duration:</strong> September 1, 2026 - October 5, 2026</li>
                    <li><strong>Status:</strong> Submitted and Version2 Currently in the Works</li>
                <div class="subtags">
                    <span class="subtag">Filipino Horror Game Jam 2026</span>
                    <span class="subtag">Object Assets Artist</>
                </div>
                <a href="https://itch.io/jam/filipino-horror-game-jam-2026/rate/5101029" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-link btn-danger">
